msgid "Verify ignore Kit Restriction"
msgstr "Ignorare la restrizione del kit?"

#: crates/cr-store/src/create/weapon.rs:424
msgid "The selected kit limits the character from weapons which fire ranged attacks. This weapon fires ranged attacks. Would you like to purchase it anyway?"
msgstr "Il kit scelto limita le armi che attaccano a distanza, e quest'arma attacca a distanza. Vuoi acquistarla comunque?"

